Change(genesis='66602cd0dec37d58d03eec9518ca805a7ac38ea912d2b0c366a0b67b4b9f50b6', deps=(), event=Decided(decision='lensplanning', at=datetime(2026, 11, 6, 0, 0, 0), actor='owner', title='Plan a change as a named expert would have written it, then review it through the same eyes', body='Every brief names the people whose work the change should read like, such as the Rust maintainers, Edward Kmett, Evan Czaplicki or the git maintainers. Before writing code, the agent asks how they would have shaped this change: which types, which one general piece, what they would delete. It plans the change around that answer and says it in the pull request. After writing, it reviews the result through the same eyes. A lens that only reviews finds problems too late to change the design.', rationale='The owner, 2026-11-06: an agent should ask itself whether this is how that person would have written the code, and plan the changes around how they would have written it, when making new changes.', supersedes=()))